# .codemap — source file glob → wiki page mapping
#
# Format: <source glob>    →    <relative page path under docs/codewiki/>
#
# Rules:
#   - Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines ignored.
#   - Multiple sources can map to one page (many → one).
#   - One source CANNOT map to multiple pages — pick the most specific.
#   - Empty .codemap = sync lint disabled (default during bootstrap).
#
# Used by:
#   - Pre-commit hook: if a source file changed without its target page touched → fail
#   - Coordinator lint: periodic sync audit
#   - Implementer ingest: "which page do I update for this file?"

# Git integration hot-set (G3 — PH-152; G4 — PH-153; G5 — PH-154)
backend/app/git/reader.py              → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/git/sync.py                → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/git/parser.py              → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/git/webhook.py             → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/api/repositories.py        → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/api/tickets.py             → components/git-integration.md
backend/app/services/git_queries.py    → components/git-integration.md
